const additions=[
 {id:'fourcorners',name:'Four Corners',aliases:'Four poles, Four corners football',group:'Street',mode:'4 players · 4 goals',tagline:'PROTECT YOUR CORNER',desc:'Four players each defend a small corner goal and attack the other three.',rules:['A throw-in starts play after the ball bounces.','Each player gets one touch, then must wait until another player touches the ball.','Conceding a goal eliminates its defender.'],instructions:'Four players, four corner goals. Defend your own goal and use one touch to strike at another. E selects the target corner; hold Space to kick when the ball is in reach. You cannot touch twice in succession. This knockout preset ends with the last defender; street versions can rotate waiting players in.',refs:['fourcorners'],note:'You confirmed four players and four corner goals. Throw/bounce and alternating touches follow the cited Ghanaian account. Last-defender knockout is this match preset; the documented queue version brings another player in.'},
 {id:'penalties',name:'Penalties',aliases:'Penalty shootout, spot kicks',group:'Street',mode:'Shoot & keep',tagline:'PICK YOUR CORNER',desc:'Take turns taking a penalty and defending the goal.',rules:['Shoot from the spot with one keeper in goal.','A ball must cross the goal line between the posts and below the bar.','Alternate taking kicks and keeping.'],instructions:'Aim left/right and up/down, or tap the goal. Hold Shoot to set power. On the next turn you keep: Q dives left, Space holds the centre, E dives right. Five kicks each, then paired sudden death if level. Saves depend on the ball and keeper meeting.',refs:[],note:'Five kicks each followed by paired sudden death is the selected shootout format.'},
 {id:'onepole',name:'One Pole',aliases:'One post, one-pole football',group:'Street',mode:'End-to-end pole duel',tagline:'HIT THE POLE',desc:'Two players stand at opposite ends and try to hit each other’s single pole.',rules:['Each end has one pole.','A direct ball hit on the opposite pole scores.','The player with more hits wins.'],instructions:'Aim left/right or tap toward the far pole. Hold Strike for pace, then release. Only contact with the actual pole scores — a wide ball crossing the end line does not. This round gives each player six shots.',refs:[],note:'Core rules supplied by you. Six alternating attempts per player is a declared round-length choice.'},
 {id:'laski',name:'Laski',aliases:'Lasky, Laskie, keeper elimination football',group:'Street',mode:'One keeper · elimination',tagline:'SCORE. CHOOSE WHO LEAVES.',desc:'A keeper throws the ball into several players. The scorer earns an elimination choice.',rules:['One keeper throws the ball into the field players.','A player who scores chooses one other player to eliminate.','Play continues until one field player remains.','The winner chooses to be keeper or a field player in the next game.'],instructions:'Win the keeper’s throw-in. Move, sprint, tackle and hold Shoot; E volleys an airborne ball. Score to choose ONE other player to eliminate. Crossing the chalk lines does not restart play: chase the ball and keep attacking. Rebounds remain live. The last player wins and chooses keeper or player for the next game.',refs:[],note:'Rules supplied by you. This match starts with four field players and one keeper.'},
 {id:'rubberband',name:'Tyre — rubber band',aliases:'Tyre, tire, rubber-band stick target, wall stick',group:'Skill',mode:'Wall-stick target duel',tagline:'PULL. AIM. RELEASE.',desc:'A small stick projects from a wall; players aim rubber bands at it.',rules:['Attach a small stick to the wall as the target.','Pull and release a rubber band toward it.','A band must hit the stick to score.'],instructions:'Tap the wall or use the arrows to aim. Hold Pull to stretch the rubber band, then release. Force changes the flight and drop; watch where it lands and adjust. E centres your aim. Six bands each in this duel. This is separate from tyre rolling.',refs:[],note:'The wall-stick and rubber-band game is based on your description. Alternating six attempts and one point per hit are the chosen digital duel format.'}
];
