const penaltyGame=catalogue.find(g=>g.id==='penalties');penaltyGame.instructions='Timing controls: press Space to lock the moving aim target, then press again to stop the power meter. Free-aim controls: use arrows or tap the goal, then hold and release Space. Your player runs up before striking. On keeper turns Q dives left, Space stays central and E dives right, relative to your view. Five kicks each with an early win when the other side cannot catch up, then paired sudden death. C changes camera.';penaltyGame.refs=['footballReference'];penaltyGame.note='A conventional shootout preset. Ball flight, keeper reach and physical posts determine saves and goals. Rebuilt independently from observed mechanics.';
street.instructions='Choose 1–7 players per side, small or big goals and a playing surface. Move with WASD or the joystick. Hold Space to strike, F shoots low, R chips, E passes, Q switches and Shift sprints. Without possession Space tackles. C cycles broadcast, behind-player and high cameras. Highest score after two minutes wins.';street.refs=[...new Set([...street.refs,'footballReference'])];

