Object.assign(catalogue.find(g=>g.id==='fourcorners'),{desc:'Four players defend one goal each at the midpoint of the four sides.',rules:['One player defends each of the four side goals.','A goal costs the defender one life.','The last defender with lives remaining wins.'],instructions:'Four players defend goals at the middle of the four sides. Choose blocks, sticks, footwear or a full net, then 1, 3 or 5 lives and dribbling or one-touch control. Collect and dribble the ball, then attack an exposed goal. Tap Shoot for a placed strike or hold for power. Without the ball it tackles. E selects a goal, Q dodges and R chips; on phones Chip is in More. Aim with movement while shooting. Blocks and footwear are low goals.',note:'The side-centred layout is your corrected rule. Match length and control options are selectable presets.'});
Object.assign(catalogue.find(g=>g.id==='sulia'),{experimental:false,mode:'Nutmeg & chase',tagline:'THROUGH THE LEGS.',desc:'Nutmeg another player to score a point. The nutmegged player is chased by the other players.',rules:['The ball must pass between another player’s legs.','The player who makes the nutmeg earns one point.','The nutmegged player receives the group reaction, then play continues.'],instructions:'Move and win the ball. E selects a player; hold Space and release to thread a low ball through their legs. Q shields the ball. A genuine nutmeg earns one point and starts a brief chase-and-tag reaction. Five players; first to five points or most points after two minutes wins.',note:'Core nutmeg, scoring and group-reaction rules supplied by you. The beating is represented by a brief non-graphic chase-and-tag animation. Five players, five-point target and two-minute limit are this digital preset.'});
Object.assign(catalogue.find(g=>g.id==='counters'),{mode:'Floor bottle-cap football',tagline:'CAPS ON THE FLOOR.',desc:'Bottle caps from soft drinks and water bottles become players on the floor, with folded-paper goalposts.',rules:['Set up paper goalposts on the floor.','Flick bottle caps to strike the small ball towards the opposite goal.','A ball through the paper goal scores.'],instructions:'Choose 1–11 counters per player. Play on the concrete floor with Coke, Pepsi and water-bottle caps. Select a cap with E or tap it; aim left/right or tap a spot. Hold Flick for force and release. Put the small paper ball through the folded-paper posts. First to three goals, or highest score after 24 flicks wins.',note:'Floor setting, paper posts and bottle-cap pieces supplied by you. Choose 1–11 caps per player, alternating flicks and the match limit are this preset; the small ball is represented by crumpled paper.'});
catalogue.find(g=>g.id==='onepole').instructions='Two players, one target at each end. Choose a wooden pole, block or footwear. Q/E changes your starting position, left/right aims, and holding Space sets power. Release to run up and strike. Only an actual target hit scores. Watch the gently moving sight mark. C switches cameras. Six shots each.';
catalogue.find(g=>g.id==='laski').instructions+=' Choose net, sticks, blocks or footwear in setup. Blocks and footwear require low finishes. C changes camera; in goal, move left/right and E dives. Play every post or keeper rebound.';

const stayGame=catalogue.find(g=>g.id==='stay');Object.assign(stayGame,{mode:'Throw, hit & catch',tagline:'HIT. CATCH. CHANGE THE THROWER.',desc:'Many players share one ball. The thrower must hit another player and catch the rebound before it reaches the ground.',instructions:'Eight players. You start as thrower. Tap a player to aim or E to change target, then Space to throw. Run under a hit rebound and press Space again to catch it before it lands. A successful hit AND catch makes the hit player the thrower. If the throw misses or the catch fails, chase and collect the loose ball. Other players can kick it away with E. Move with arrows / WASD or the stick; Shift sprints.',rules:['One player throws the ball at another player.','The thrower must catch the rebound before it touches the floor to pass the role to the hit player.','After a miss or failed catch, the same thrower must chase the ball.','Other players may play the loose ball away. Recover it and repeat.'],note:'Neighbourhood rules supplied by the player. Eight-player continuous play; no forced freeze or five-throw limit.',refs:[]});

