catalogue.splice(1,0,{id:'abedemu',name:'Ab3d3mu',aliases:'Abedemu, Abɛdɛmu, middle player, keep away',group:'Street',mode:'Pass around the middle',tagline:'KEEP IT MOVING. KEEP THEM CHASING.',desc:'One player in the middle tries to take the ball while the players around them pass it between themselves.',rules:['The outside players pass the football around the middle player.','The middle player tries to intercept or tackle and win the ball.','In this preset, the last player to lose the ball swaps into the middle.'],instructions:'Move with the joystick or WASD. Tap Pass for a quick pass, or hold for power. E selects a teammate; aim with movement or tap a teammate. R lobs. In the middle, Space tackles and Q starts a short press that anticipates the ball; steering takes control. Players change passing lanes and make support runs. Close pressure can force a rushed pass or a heavy first touch. A completed pass earns 1 point; winning the ball in the middle earns 2. The last toucher takes the middle after an interception or out ball. Highest score after two minutes wins. Private friend rooms support 3–6 human players.',note:'Core passing-around-one-middle-player rules and name supplied by you. Role swaps, six-player solo layout, scoring and two-minute limit are explicit digital match conventions.',refs:[],play:true,pending:false,experimental:false});
street.instructions+=' G triggers a timed keeper save in big-poles matches. Without possession E presses toward the ball and Space tackles. Every kick-off and restart after a goal begins at the centre spot; the conceding team restarts. Formations include central CB and DM roles where numbers permit, with dynamic pressing and recovery runs.';
